    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Analyze this job posting:\n\nTitle: {{ $json.title }}\nCategories: {{ $json.categories }}\nLink: {{ $json.link }}\njob Description: {{ $json.content }}\n",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "needsFallback": true,
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "message": "=You are a job analysis engine.\n\nYour task is to extract and structure key information from a job posting.\n\nYou MUST return ONLY raw, valid JSON.\n- No markdown\n- No ```json\n- No explanations\n- No extra text\n- No \"output\" wrapper\n- No comments\n\n---\n\nINPUT:\nTitle: {{ $json.title }}\nCategories: {{ $json.categories }}\nLink: {{ $json.link }}\nDescription: {{ $json.content }}\n\n---\n\nOUTPUT SCHEMA (follow EXACTLY):\n\n{\n  \"title\": \"string\",\n  \"company\": \"string or null\",\n  \"location\": \"string or 'remote'\",\n  \"experience_level\": \"junior | mid | senior | unknown\",\n  \"required_skills\": [\"string\"],\n  \"nice_to_have_skills\": [\"string\"],\n  \"technologies\": [\"string\"],\n  \"job_type\": \"full-time | part-time | contract | internship | unknown\",\n  \"summary\": \"string\",\n  \"apply_link\": \"string\"\n}\n\n---\n\nRULES:\n- Extract company from description if possible, else null\n- Infer experience_level from terms like junior, senior, or years\n- Keep skills short (1–3 words each), no sentences\n- Remove duplicates\n- Limit required_skills to max 8 items\n- Limit nice_to_have_skills to max 5 items\n- Summary must be 2–3 short lines (max 40 words)\n- If data missing → use null or \"unknown\"\n- apply_link MUST be the provided link\n- Ensure ALL fields are present\n\n---\n\nCRITICAL:\nReturn ONLY valid JSON.\nThe response must be directly parsable by JSON.parse()."
            }
          ]
        },
        "batching": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
      "position": [
        1040,
        -16
      ],
      "id": "23e56e9b-dc72-4429-a381-925b6588b527",
      "name": "Basic LLM Chain",
